            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Local Wholesale Grass Seed Supplier in Aspen for 35 Years",
            "text": "<p>Getting grass to grow in Aspen’s dry summers and high elevation isn’t always easy. Between thin soil, cold snaps, and uneven light, it helps to start with seed that’s made for these conditions. </p><p>We’ve stocked a range of seed blends that cover everything from shady yards to open pastures and high-traffic turf grass areas. You’ll find fast growers, hardy mixes,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> turf seed</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Wildflowers+%26+Grass+Seed\" target=\"_blank\"> wildflowers</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Trending\" target=\"_blank\"> custom blend seeds</a> tailored for lawns, slopes, and project sites. Rivendell Distribution is a family-owned business near Glenwood Springs with years of experience helping our mountain region grow the right way.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
